case of any pre-Issue or post-Issue related issues regarding share certificates/demat credit/refund orders/unblocking etc., investors
can reach out to the Company Secretary and Compliance Officer. For details of Company Secretary and Compliance Officer, please
see the section entitled “General Information” and “Our Management” beginning on pages 52 and 156 respectively.

For helpline details of the BRLM pursuant to the SEBI/HO/CFD/DIL2/CIR/P/2021/2480/1/M dated March 16, 2021, please see the
section entitled “General Information” beginning on page 52.

